Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), "Admin 1 - States, Provinces", escala 1:10m.
Dominio público: "All versions of Natural Earth raster + vector map data found on this website are in the public domain.
You may use the maps in any manner, including modifying the content and design, electronic dissemination, and offset
printing. The primary authors, Tom Patterson and Nathaniel Vaughn Kelso, and all other contributors renounce all claim
to copyright interest in the original works." (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/)
Copia usada: github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector, geojson/ne_10m_admin_1_states_provinces.geojson (24 jurisdicciones de Argentina).
Modificaciones: proyección equirectangular (longitud x cos 40 grados), simplificación Douglas-Peucker a 0,03 grados,
islas menores a 0,1 grados cuadrados descartadas, solo anillos exteriores. Script: tools/geo_provincias.py.
Nota: son los límites de Natural Earth, no una posición oficial del IGN.
